OL,3,GNEWSAThree SEND school minibuses
OL,4,Avandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA special educational needs primary
OL,7,Fschool has had three of its five
OL,8,Fminibuses vandalised.
OL,10,FPriory Woods School and Arts College in
OL,11,FMiddlesbrough said on social media it
OL,12,Fhad shared footage with Cleveland
OL,13,FPolice showing two individuals on the
OL,14,Fschool site smashing up the vehicles.
OL,16,FThe Teesside Family Foundation
OL,17,Fpreviously contributed #30,000 towards
OL,18,Fone of the damaged minibuses.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
