OL,3,GNEWSAThree SEND school minibuses
OL,4,Avandalised
OL,5,
OL,6,FFoundation founder Tony Wedlake said
OL,7,Fseeing the vehicles damaged was
OL,8,F"heartbreaking", but there were plans
OL,9,Fto raise more money to make sure
OL,10,Fopportunities were not taken away from
OL,11,Fchildren.
